# hand and the Moxen's sacrifice was still paid. Only one of them may be chosen to go onto the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Entomb
Entomb
Back for Seconds
Memnite
Ornithopter
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

